---
/* Primitives: the smallest pieces one at a time, then composed. The page's
   script supplies the band-chip label vocabulary. */
---

<section class="station-section" id="primitives" aria-labelledby="primitives-title">
  <h2 id="primitives-title">Primitives</h2>
  <p class="station-note">
    The smallest pieces, one at a time — then composed. Every atom
    is a plain inline element you can drop into your own markup.
  </p>
  <div class="station-primitives">
    <div class="station-panel station-specimens">
      <h3>The atoms — the feed&rsquo;s primary station, one element at a time</h3>
      <div class="station-specimen-grid">
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-speed&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value"><meteo-speed></meteo-speed></div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-gust&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value"><meteo-gust></meteo-gust></div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-lull&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value"><meteo-lull></meteo-lull></div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-direction&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value"><meteo-direction></meteo-direction></div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-temperature&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value"><meteo-temperature></meteo-temperature></div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-pressure station-id="valley-tempest"&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value">
            <meteo-pressure station-id="valley-tempest"></meteo-pressure>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-updated-at&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value"><meteo-updated-at></meteo-updated-at></div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-band-chip&gt; + labels</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value">
            <meteo-band-chip
              class="station-chip"
              thresholds='{"unit":"kmh","values":[5,12,20,28]}'
            ></meteo-band-chip>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="station-specimen">
          <code>&lt;meteo-sparkline&gt;</code>
          <div class="station-specimen-value"><meteo-sparkline></meteo-sparkline></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="station-panel station-primitive-sentence">
      <h3>Composed — the atoms disappear into your own prose</h3>
      <p class="station-sentence">
        Right now at Launch Ridge it&rsquo;s blowing <meteo-speed></meteo-speed> from
        the <meteo-direction></meteo-direction>, gusting <meteo-gust></meteo-gust> —
        updated <meteo-updated-at></meteo-updated-at>.
      </p>
      <code class="station-sentence-source">
        Right now at &#123;station.name&#125; it's blowing &lt;meteo-speed&gt; from the
        &lt;meteo-direction&gt;, gusting &lt;meteo-gust&gt; — updated &lt;meteo-updated-at&gt;.
      </code>
    </div>
    <div class="station-primitives-row">
      <div class="station-panel">
        <h3>Band chips across the fleet — five words over 5 · 12 · 20 · 28 km/h</h3>
        <p class="station-caption">
          These chips declare four bounds of their own, overriding the page
          feed&rsquo;s 12 · 20 · 28 km/h — thresholds are the consumer&rsquo;s,
          per feed or per element.
        </p>
        <div class="station-chip-list">
          <div class="station-chip-item">
            <span>Launch Ridge</span>
            <meteo-band-chip
              class="station-chip"
              station-id="launch-ridge"
              thresholds='{"unit":"kmh","values":[5,12,20,28]}'
            ></meteo-band-chip>
          </div>
          <div class="station-chip-item">
            <span>Summit Logger</span>
            <meteo-band-chip
              class="station-chip"
              station-id="summit-logger"
              thresholds='{"unit":"kmh","values":[5,12,20,28]}'
            ></meteo-band-chip>
          </div>
          <div class="station-chip-item">
            <span>Valley Tempest</span>
            <meteo-band-chip
              class="station-chip"
              station-id="valley-tempest"
              thresholds='{"unit":"kmh","values":[5,12,20,28]}'
            ></meteo-band-chip>
          </div>
          <div class="station-chip-item">
            <span>North Bluff</span>
            <meteo-band-chip
              class="station-chip"
              station-id="north-bluff"
              thresholds='{"unit":"kmh","values":[5,12,20,28]}'
            ></meteo-band-chip>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="station-panel">
        <h3>The bare dial — one 160-unit drawing, any size</h3>
        <div class="station-dials">
          <figure class="station-dial-figure">
            <meteo-dial size="120" station-id="launch-ridge"></meteo-dial>
            <figcaption>size="120"</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="station-dial-figure">
            <meteo-dial size="200" station-id="launch-ridge"></meteo-dial>
            <figcaption>size="200"</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="station-panel">
      <h3>Strips with sparklines — the board-row pairing</h3>
      <div
        class="station-board"
        role="region"
        tabindex="0"
        aria-label="Scrollable station board rows"
      >
        <div class="station-board-row">
          <meteo-station-strip station-id="launch-ridge"></meteo-station-strip>
          <meteo-sparkline station-id="launch-ridge"></meteo-sparkline>
        </div>
        <div class="station-board-row">
          <meteo-station-strip station-id="summit-logger"></meteo-station-strip>
          <meteo-sparkline station-id="summit-logger"></meteo-sparkline>
        </div>
        <div class="station-board-row">
          <meteo-station-strip station-id="valley-tempest"></meteo-station-strip>
          <meteo-sparkline station-id="valley-tempest"></meteo-sparkline>
        </div>
        <div class="station-board-row">
          <meteo-station-strip station-id="north-bluff"></meteo-station-strip>
          <meteo-sparkline station-id="north-bluff"></meteo-sparkline>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="station-panel">
      <h3>Freshness — the presenter, all three words</h3>
      <p class="station-caption">
        <code>&lt;meteo-freshness-badge&gt;</code> is the presenter for
        rows you compose yourself — the cards and table judge
        their own freshness from the feed&rsquo;s clocks and re-judge
        between polls.
      </p>
      <div class="station-badges">
        <meteo-freshness-badge status="live"></meteo-freshness-badge>
        <meteo-freshness-badge status="aging"></meteo-freshness-badge>
        <meteo-freshness-badge status="stale"></meteo-freshness-badge>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .station-primitives {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .station-specimens {
    padding-block-end: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .station-specimen-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 170px), 1fr));
    margin: 0 -1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .station-specimen {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-block-end: -1px; /* the outer card clips the last row's rule */
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem 1rem;
    border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .station-specimen > code {
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    font: 0.7rem/1.5 var(--mono);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .station-specimen-value {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 1.6rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .station-primitive-sentence {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem 1.3rem;
  }

  /* Body size on purpose: the atoms are built for running prose, and
     scaling them up only amplifies their internal seams. */
  .station-sentence {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* The markup that composed the sentence above it — output, then source. */
  .station-sentence-source {
    display: block;
    margin-block-start: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--rule);
    background: none;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    font: 0.76rem/1.6 var(--mono);
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .station-primitives-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .station-chip {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .station-chip-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .station-chip-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block-end: 0.55rem;
    border-block-end: 1px dashed var(--rule);
  }

  .station-chip-item:last-child {
    padding-block-end: 0;
    border-block-end: none;
  }

  .station-chip-item > span {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .station-dials {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .station-dial-figure {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .station-dial-figure figcaption {
    color: var(--ink-mute);
    font: 0.7rem/1.4 var(--mono);
  }

  /* The classic board row: a strip stating the reading, a sparkline showing
     the six hours behind it. The strip's children become the flex items
     (the host erases its box), so the region scrolls on phones exactly as
     the strips section does. */
  .station-board {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-block-end: 0.25rem;
  }

  .station-board-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: max-content;
  }

  .station-board-row :global(.meteo-strip) {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .station-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
